#, php-format
msgid "The database of the grid cannot be reached: %s"
msgstr "Il database della griglia non è raggiungibile: %s"

msgid "Destinations Guide"
msgstr "Guida delle destinazioni"

msgid "This is a work in progress, please be indulgent."
msgstr "Questo è un lavoro in corso, per favore sii indulgente."

msgid ""
"The realm of destinations you seek has eluded our grasp, spirited away by "
"elusive knomes. Rally the grid managers, let them venture forth to curate a "
"grand tapestry of remarkable places for your exploration!"
msgstr ""
"The magical realm of destinations you're searching for has slipped through "
"our fingers, hidden away by mischievous creatures. Gather the grid managers "
"and send them on a quest to curate a magnificent collection of extraordinary "
"places for you to explore!"

